The LegalAgent adaptation adds legal material intake, source and citation
tools, an optional retrieval HTTP adapter, persistent case workflow,
legal task prompts and skills, and a local web interface.

The release includes source code, synthetic examples, and public provider
catalog metadata. It does not include model weights, training datasets,
legal corpora, vector indices, deployment credentials, or real case records.

This project is not an official Pi release and is not affiliated with a
model provider, law firm, or judicial authority.
